OL,3,ATrump wants a new Camp David-like
OL,4,Aretreat at his Florida golf club
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump is looking to
OL,7,Fcreate a presidential retreat similar
OL,8,Fto Camp David at his Florida golf club.
OL,10,FThe club would foot constructions costs
OL,11,Fas a "gift" to Americans and provide
OL,12,Ffree memberships to future presidents -
OL,13,Fand accommodations to visiting foreign
OL,14,Fdignitaries.
OL,16,F"It's only about two minutes away from
OL,17,Fthe airport ... and they could spend
OL,18,Fthe weekend there, like a retreat, like
OL,19,Fa sort of Camp David retreat," Trump
OL,20,Fsaid on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
