OL,3,ATrump wants a new Camp David-like
OL,4,Aretreat at his Florida golf club
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf it comes to fruition, Trump's
OL,7,Ftransformed golf estate would stand in
OL,8,Fstark contrast to the rustic Camp
OL,9,FDavid, once a Great Depression-era camp
OL,10,Fin the woods for federal employees. It
OL,11,Fwould also mark another tradition
OL,12,Ftransformed by Trump.
